		<title><![CDATA[Cheliyala Katta (చెలియల కట్ట)]]></title>
		<link>http://localhost:8888/books/cheliyala-katta-%e0%b0%9a%e0%b1%86%e0%b0%b2%e0%b0%bf%e0%b0%af%e0%b0%b2-%e0%b0%95%e0%b0%9f%e0%b1%8d%e0%b0%9f/</link>
